BBSList.trans V 1.0 by Georg 'Gio' Magschok for Tim Aston's TransAmiga BBS V1.1

 What's it:
  BBSList.trans is a little  ARexx-Script to have a comfortable
  BBSList available unter TransAmiga BBS V1.1.

 Installation:
  You have to run ARexx (V1.15) and TransAmiga V1.1.
  Copy "BBSList.trans" to your bbs:rexx/ -dir
  Change the paths and the data for BBS No. 1 in the header
  of the script.
  Edit the included Menufiles "bbslistmenu" and
  "bbslistmenu.ansi" to fit your design needs.
  If you change the Keys used for the menu selections
  don't forget to change them in the script, too.

  Copy your two new menus to bbs:text/

  Edit your .rx file of the menu where you want to
  include the bbslist, my Bulletin.rx looks
  like that:

; ********************** *** ******** *******************
I BBS Liste              050 -------- BBSlist.trans

